3. NXP S32DS Reference Application & RTD / gPTP Components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NXP Real-Time Drivers (RTD/), S32 Configuration Tools auto-generated files
(generate/, board/), and the NXP SJA1110 gPTP software stack (gptp_stack/) are
excluded from this repository (.gitignore) and are automatically populated from
the user's local NXP S32 Design Studio installation when running "Update Code"
on SJA1110-MGS_gPTP_FreeRTOS.mex.

Any remaining S32DS project template and startup files (src/, include/,
Project_Settings/, tool/createNvmImage.py, tool/createDBImage.py) are governed
by the NXP Software License Agreement (LA_OPT_NXP_Software_License) bundled with
NXP S32 Design Studio and SJA1110 RTD.
